(11449,44,219,'paragraph',NULL,'As iodine is a better leaving group because of its large size, it will be released at a faster rate in the presence of incoming nucleophile.','[{"s": "As iodine is a better leaving group because of its large size, it will be released at a faster rate in the presence of incoming nucleophile.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
