(13128,45,128,'paragraph',NULL,'ii) Alkyl halides on treatment with sodium metal in dry ethereal (free from moisture) solution give higher alkanes. This reaction is known as Wurtz reaction and is used for the preparation of higher alkanes containing even number of carbon atoms.','[{"s": "ii) Alkyl halides on treatment with sodium metal in dry ethereal (free from moisture) solution give higher alkanes.", "t": "text"}, {"s": "This reaction is known as", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "Wurtz reaction", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "and is used for the preparation of higher alkanes containing even number of carbon", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "", "t": "br"}, {"s": "atoms.", "t": "text"}]','marked','["130803"]',NULL),
