(13450,45,450,'paragraph',NULL,'B. Addition reactions: Alkynes contain a triple bond, so they add up, two molecules of dihydrogen, halogen, hydrogen halides etc. Formation of the addition product takes place according to the following steps.','[{"s": "B. Addition reactions:", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Alkynes contain a triple bond, so they add up, two molecules of dihydrogen, halogen, hydrogen halides etc. Formation of the addition product takes place according to the following steps.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
