(13452,45,452,'paragraph',NULL,'The addition product formed depends upon stability of vinylic cation . Addition in unsymmetrical alkynes takes place according to Markovnikov rule. Majority of the reactions of alkynes are the examples of electrophilic addition reactions. A few addition reactions are given below:','[{"s": "The addition product formed depends upon stability of vinylic cation", "t": "text"}, {"s": ".", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Addition in unsymmetrical alkynes takes place according to Markovnikov rule.", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "Majority of the reactions of alkynes are the examples of electrophilic addition reactions. A few addition reactions are given below:", "t": "text"}]','marked','["131522"]',NULL),
