(13464,45,464,'paragraph',NULL,'Like alkanes and alkenes, alkynes are also immiscible and do not react with water. However, one molecule of water adds to alkynes on warming with mercuric sulphate and dilute sulphuric acid at 333 K to form carbonyl compounds. 2','[{"s": "Like alkanes and alkenes, alkynes are also immiscible and do not react with water. However, one molecule of water adds to alkynes on warming with mercuric sulphate and dilute sulphuric acid at 333 K to form carbonyl compounds.", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "2", "t": "hl"}]','marked','["130843", "131510", "131523"]',NULL),
