(13583,45,583,'paragraph',NULL,'Under ultra-violet light, three chlorine molecules add to benzene to produce benzene hexachloride, C6H6Cl6 which is also called gammaxane.','[{"s": "Under ultra-violet light, three chlorine molecules add to benzene to produce benzene hexachloride, C6H6Cl6 which is also called gammaxane.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
