(14856,46,205,'paragraph',NULL,'Cyclic Compounds: A saturated monocyclic compound is named by prefixing ‘cyclo’ to the corresponding straight chain alkane. If side chains are present, then the rules given above are applied. Names of some cyclic compounds are given below.','[{"s": "Cyclic Compounds:", "t": "text"}, {"s": "A saturated monocyclic compound is named by prefixing ‘cyclo’ to the corresponding straight chain alkane. If side chains are present, then the rules given above are applied. Names of some cyclic compounds are given below.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
