(17622,49,715,'paragraph',NULL,'Fig. 7.9 The structures of (a) XeF 2 (b) XeF 4 (c) XeF 6 (d) XeOF 4 and (e) XeO 3','[{"s": "Fig. 7.9", "t": "text"}, {"s": "The structures of (a) XeF", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "(b) XeF", "t": "text"}, {"s": "4", "t": "text"}, {"s": "(c) XeF", "t": "text"}, {"s": "6", "t": "text"}, {"s": "(d) XeOF", "t": "text"}, {"s": "4", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and (e) XeO", "t": "text"}, {"s": "3", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(17623,49,716,'paragraph',NULL,'XeO 3 is a colourless explosive solid and has a pyramidal molecular structure (Fig. 7.9). XeOF 4 is a colourless volatile liquid and has a square pyramidal molecular structure (Fig.7.9).','[{"s": "XeO", "t": "text"}, {"s": "3", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is a colourless explosive solid and has a pyramidal molecular structure (Fig. 7.9). XeOF", "t": "text"}, {"s": "4", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is a colourless volatile liquid and has a square pyramidal molecular structure (Fig.7.9).", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(17624,49,717,'paragraph',NULL,'Example 7.22','[{"s": "Example 7.22", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(17625,49,718,'paragraph',NULL,'Does the hydrolysis of XeF 6 lead to a redox reaction?','[{"s": "Does the hydrolysis of XeF", "t": "text"}, {"s": "6", "t": "text"}, {"s": "lead to a redox reaction?", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(17626,49,719,'paragraph',NULL,'Solution','[{"s": "Solution", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(17627,49,720,'paragraph',NULL,'No, the products of hydrolysis are XeOF 4 and XeO 2 F 2 where the oxidation states of all the elements remain the same as it was in the reacting state.','[{"s": "No, the products of hydrolysis are XeOF", "t": "text"}, {"s": "4", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and XeO", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "F", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "where the oxidation states of all the elements remain the same as it was in the reacting state.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(17628,49,721,'paragraph',NULL,'Uses : Helium is a non-inflammable and light gas. Hence, it is used in filling balloons for meteorological observations. It is also used in gas-cooled nuclear reactors. Liquid helium (b.p. 4.2 K) finds use as cryogenic agent for carrying out various experiments at low temperatures. It is used to produce and sustain powerful superconducting magnets which form an essential part of modern NMR spectrometers and Magnetic Resonance Imaging (MRI) systems for clinical diagnosis. It is used as a diluent for oxygen in modern diving apparatus because of its very low solubility in blood.','[{"s": "Uses", "t": "text"}, {"s": ": Helium is a non-inflammable and light gas. Hence, it is used in filling balloons for meteorological observations. It is also used in gas-cooled nuclear reactors. Liquid helium (b.p. 4.2 K) finds use as cryogenic agent for carrying out various experiments at low temperatures. It is used to produce and sustain powerful superconducting magnets which form an essential part of modern NMR spectrometers and Magnetic Resonance Imaging (MRI) systems for clinical diagnosis. It is used as a diluent for oxygen in modern diving apparatus because of its very low solubility in blood.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(17629,49,722,'paragraph',NULL,'Neon is used in discharge tubes and fluorescent bulbs for advertisement display purposes. Neon bulbs are used in botanical gardens and in green houses.','[{"s": "Neon is used in discharge tubes and fluorescent bulbs for advertisement display purposes. Neon bulbs are used in botanical gardens and in green houses.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(17630,49,723,'paragraph',NULL,'Argon is used mainly to provide an inert atmosphere in high temperature metallurgical processes (arc welding of metals or alloys) and for filling electric bulbs. It is also used in the laboratory for handling substances that are air-sensitive.','[{"s": "Argon is used mainly to provide an inert atmosphere in high temperature metallurgical processes (arc welding of metals or alloys) and for filling electric bulbs. It is also used in the laboratory for handling substances that are air-sensitive.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(17631,49,724,'paragraph',NULL,'There are no significant uses of Xenon and Krypton. They are used in light bulbs designed for special purposes.','[{"s": "There are no significant uses of Xenon and Krypton. They are used in light bulbs designed for special purposes.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(17632,49,725,'paragraph',NULL,'Intext Questions','[{"s": "Intext Questions", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
