(26428,65,490,'paragraph',NULL,'Q.24 Consider the plane S formed by the dipole axis and the axis of the earth. Let P be the point on the magnetic equator and in S. Let Q be the point of intersection of the geographical and magnetic equators. Obtain the declination and dip angles at P and Q.','[{"s": "Q.24 Consider the plane S formed by the dipole axis and the axis of the earth. Let P be the point on the magnetic equator and in S. Let Q be the point of intersection of the geographical and magnetic equators. Obtain the declination and dip angles at P and Q.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
