(17702,50,57,'paragraph',NULL,'Since in the above reaction the compound formed is an ionic compound, which may also be represented as Na+H– (s), this suggests that one half reaction in this process is :','[{"s": "Since in the above reaction the compound formed is an ionic compound, which may also be represented as Na+H– (s), this suggests that one half reaction in this process is :", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
