(17851,50,206,'paragraph',NULL,'In each case, the reducing metal is a better reducing agent than the one that is being reduced which evidently shows more capability to lose electrons as compared to the one that is reduced.','[{"s": "In each case, the reducing metal is a better reducing agent than the one that is being reduced which evidently shows more capability to lose electrons as compared to the one that is reduced.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
