(17912,50,267,'paragraph',NULL,'Among the oxoanions of chlorine listed above, ClO 4 – does not disproportionate because in this oxoanion chlorine is present in its highest oxidation state that is, +7 . The disproportionation reactions for the other three oxoanions of chlorine are as follows:','[{"s": "Among the oxoanions of chlorine listed above, ClO", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "4", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "–", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "does not disproportionate because in this oxoanion chlorine is present in its highest oxidation state that is, +7", "t": "hl"}, {"s": ".", "t": "text"}, {"s": "The disproportionation reactions for the other three oxoanions of chlorine are as follows:", "t": "text"}]','marked','["220835"]',NULL),
