(18455,51,334,'paragraph',NULL,'Molecules of ethanoic acid (acetic acid) dimerise in benzene due to hydrogen bonding. This normally happens in solvents of low dielectric constant. In this case the number of particles is reduced due to dimerisation. Association of molecules is depicted as follows:','[{"s": "Molecules of ethanoic acid (acetic acid) dimerise in benzene due to hydrogen bonding. This normally happens in solvents of low dielectric constant. In this case the number of particles is reduced due to dimerisation. Association of molecules is depicted as follows:", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(18456,51,335,'paragraph',NULL,'It can be undoubtedly stated here that if all the molecules of ethanoic acid associate in benzene, then ∆T b or ∆T f for ethanoic acid will be half of the normal value. The molar mass calculated on the basis of this ∆T b or ∆T f will, therefore, be twice the expected value. Such a molar mass that is either lower or higher than the expected or normal value is called as abnormal molar mass .','[{"s": "It can be undoubtedly stated here that if all the molecules of ethanoic acid associate in benzene, then ∆T", "t": "text"}, {"s": "b", "t": "text"}, {"s": "or ∆T", "t": "text"}, {"s": "f", "t": "text"}, {"s": "for ethanoic acid will be half of the normal value. The molar mass calculated on the basis of this ∆T", "t": "text"}, {"s": "b", "t": "text"}, {"s": "or ∆T", "t": "text"}, {"s": "f", "t": "text"}, {"s": "will, therefore, be twice the expected value. Such a molar mass that is either lower or higher than the expected or normal value is called as", "t": "text"}, {"s": "abnormal molar mass", "t": "text"}, {"s": ".", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(18457,51,336,'paragraph',NULL,'In 1880 van’t Hoff introduced a factor i, known as the van’t Hoff factor, to account for the extent of dissociation or association. 2 This factor i is defined as:','[{"s": "In 1880 van’t Hoff introduced a factor i, known as the van’t Hoff factor, to account for the extent of dissociation or association.", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "2", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "This factor i is defined as:", "t": "text"}]','marked','["160951", "160980"]',NULL),
