(18522,51,401,'paragraph',NULL,'2.9 A sample of drinking water was found to be severely contaminated with chloroform (CHCl 3 ) supposed to be a carcinogen. The level of contamination was 15 ppm (by mass):','[{"s": "2.9 A sample of drinking water was found to be severely contaminated with chloroform (CHCl", "t": "text"}, {"s": "3", "t": "text"}, {"s": ") supposed to be a carcinogen. The level of contamination was 15 ppm (by mass):", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
