(19402,52,389,'paragraph',NULL,'According to the above equation, 1 mol N 2 (g) requires 3 mol H 2 (g), for the reaction. Hence, for 17.86×102 mol of N 2 , the moles of H 2 (g) required would be','[{"s": "According to the above equation, 1 mol N", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "(g) requires 3 mol H", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "(g), for the reaction. Hence, for 17.86×102 mol of N", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": ", the moles of H", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "(g) required would be", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
