(19422,52,409,'paragraph',NULL,'It is the ratio of number of moles of a particular component to the total number of moles of the solution. If a substance ‘A’ dissolves in substance ‘B’ and their number of moles are n A and n B , respectively, then the mole fractions of A and B are given as:','[{"s": "It is the ratio of number of moles of a particular component to the total number of moles of the solution.", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "If a substance ‘A’ dissolves in substance ‘B’ and their number of moles are n", "t": "text"}, {"s": "A", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and n", "t": "text"}, {"s": "B", "t": "text"}, {"s": ", respectively, then the mole fractions of A and B are given as:", "t": "text"}]','marked','["11112"]',NULL),
