(19434,52,421,'paragraph',NULL,'In fact for such calculations, a general formula, M 1 × V 1 = M 2 × V 2 where M and V are molarity and volume, respectively, can be used. In this case, M 1 is equal to 0.2M; V 1 = 1000 mL and, M 2 = 1.0M; V 2 is to be calculated. Substituting the values in the formula:','[{"s": "In fact for such calculations, a general formula, M", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "1", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "× V", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "1", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "= M", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "2", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "× V", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "2", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "where M and V are molarity and volume, respectively, can be used.", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "In this case, M", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is equal to 0.2M; V", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "= 1000 mL and, M", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "= 1.0M; V", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is to be calculated. Substituting the values in the formula:", "t": "text"}]','marked','["160905"]',NULL),
