(20585,54,223,'paragraph',NULL,'Here symbol Σ (sigma) is used for summation and a i and b i are the stoichiometric coefficients of the products and reactants respectively in the balanced chemical equation. For example, for the reaction','[{"s": "Here symbol Σ (sigma) is used for summation and a", "t": "text"}, {"s": "i", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and b", "t": "text"}, {"s": "i", "t": "text"}, {"s": "are the stoichiometric coefficients of the products and reactants respectively in the balanced chemical equation. For example, for the reaction", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
