(21637,55,607,'paragraph',NULL,'Q. 1. If the RMS current in a 50 Hz AC circuit is 5 A, the value of the current 1/300 s after its value becomes zero is','[{"s": "Q. 1. If the RMS current in a 50 Hz AC circuit is 5 A, the value of the current 1/300 s after its value becomes zero is", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
