(21642,55,612,'paragraph',NULL,'Q. 2. An alternating current generator has an internal resistance R g and an internal resistance X g . It is used to supply power to a passive load consisting of a resistance R g and a resistance X L . For maximum power to be delivered from the generator to the load, the value of X L is equal to','[{"s": "Q. 2. An alternating current generator has an internal resistance", "t": "text"}, {"s": "R", "t": "text"}, {"s": "g", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and an internal resistance", "t": "text"}, {"s": "X", "t": "text"}, {"s": "g", "t": "text"}, {"s": ". It is used to supply power to a passive load consisting of a resistance", "t": "text"}, {"s": "R", "t": "text"}, {"s": "g", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and a resistance", "t": "text"}, {"s": "X", "t": "text"}, {"s": "L", "t": "text"}, {"s": ". For maximum power to be delivered from the generator to the load, the value of", "t": "text"}, {"s": "X", "t": "text"}, {"s": "L", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is equal to", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(21643,55,613,'paragraph',NULL,'(a) zero','[{"s": "(a) zero", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(21644,55,614,'paragraph',NULL,'(b) X g','[{"s": "(b) X", "t": "text"}, {"s": "g", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
