(21647,55,617,'paragraph',NULL,'Q. 3. When a voltage measuring device is connected to AC mains, the meter shows the steady input voltage of 220 V. This means','[{"s": "Q. 3. When a voltage measuring device is connected to AC mains, the meter shows the steady input voltage of 220 V. This means", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
