(21662,55,632,'paragraph',NULL,'Q. 6. An inductor of reactance 1 Ω and a resistor of 2 Ω are connected in series to the terminals of a 6V (rms) AC source. The power dissipated in the circuit is','[{"s": "Q. 6. An inductor of reactance 1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Ω", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and a resistor of 2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Ω", "t": "text"}, {"s": "are connected in series to the terminals of a 6V (rms) AC source. The power dissipated in the circuit is", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
