(21672,55,642,'paragraph',NULL,'Q. 8. As the frequency of an AC circuit increases, the current first increases then decreases. What combination of circuit elements is most likely to comprise the circuit?','[{"s": "Q. 8. As the frequency of an AC circuit increases, the current first increases then decreases. What combination of circuit elements is most likely to comprise the circuit?", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
