(21677,55,647,'paragraph',NULL,'Q. 9. In an alternating current circuit consisting of elements in series, the current increases on increasing the frequency of the supply. Which of the following elements are likely to constitute the circuit?','[{"s": "Q. 9. In an alternating current circuit consisting of elements in series, the current increases on increasing the frequency of the supply. Which of the following elements are likely to constitute the circuit?", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
