(21725,55,695,'paragraph',NULL,'Q. 27. An electrical device draws 2 kW power from AC mains (voltage 223 V (rms)= √50000 V). The current differs (lags) in phase by ϕ (tanϕ= −3/4 ) as compared to voltage. Find (a) R, (b) X C −X L and (c) I M X C -X L and (c) IM . Another device has twice the values for R, X C and X L . How are the answers affected?','[{"s": "Q. 27. An electrical device draws 2 kW power from AC mains (voltage 223 V (rms)=", "t": "text"}, {"s": "√50000", "t": "text"}, {"s": "V). The current differs (lags) in phase by", "t": "text"}, {"s": "ϕ (tanϕ=", "t": "text"}, {"s": "−3/4", "t": "text"}, {"s": ")", "t": "text"}, {"s": "as compared to voltage. Find (a) R, (b)", "t": "text"}, {"s": "X", "t": "text"}, {"s": "C", "t": "text"}, {"s": "−X", "t": "text"}, {"s": "L", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and (c) I", "t": "text"}, {"s": "M", "t": "text"}, {"s": "X", "t": "text"}, {"s": "C", "t": "text"}, {"s": "-X", "t": "text"}, {"s": "L", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and (c) IM", "t": "text"}, {"s": ". Another device has twice the values for", "t": "text"}, {"s": "R, X", "t": "text"}, {"s": "C", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and X", "t": "text"}, {"s": "L", "t": "text"}, {"s": ". How are the answers affected?", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
