(22175,57,59,'paragraph',NULL,'since starting with its last collision it was accelerated (Fig. 3.3) with an acceleration given by Eq. (3.15) for a time interval t i . The average velocity of the electrons at time t is the average of all the V i','[{"s": "since starting with its last collision it was accelerated (Fig. 3.3) with an acceleration given by Eq. (3.15) for a time interval t", "t": "text"}, {"s": "i", "t": "text"}, {"s": ". The average velocity of the electrons at time t is the average of all the V", "t": "text"}, {"s": "i", "t": "text"}, {"s": "", "t": "br"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
