(22191,57,75,'paragraph',NULL,'Comparison with Eq. (3.13) shows that Eq. (3.22) is exactly the Ohm’s law, if we identify the conductivity σ as','[{"s": "Comparison with Eq. (3.13) shows that Eq. (3.22) is exactly the Ohm’s law, if we identify the conductivity σ as", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
