(27824,68,531,'paragraph',NULL,'Motion_in_a_Plane-image68.png and its position vector at time t = 0 is r o , then at any other time t , it will be at a point given by:','[{"s": "Motion_in_a_Plane-image68.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "and its position vector at time", "t": "text"}, {"s": "t", "t": "text"}, {"s": "= 0 is r", "t": "text"}, {"s": "o", "t": "text"}, {"s": ", then at any other time", "t": "text"}, {"s": "t", "t": "text"}, {"s": ", it will be at a point given by:", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
