(22518,57,402,'paragraph',NULL,'Current_Electricity-image50.png [3.83(a)]','[{"s": "Current_Electricity-image50.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "[3.83(a)]", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(22520,57,404,'paragraph',NULL,'The Wheatstone bridge and its balance condition provide a practical method for determination of an unknown resistance. Let us suppose we have an unknown resistance, which we insert in the fourth arm; R 4 is thus not known. Keeping known resistances R 1 and R 2 in the first and second arm of the bridge, we go on varying R 3 till the galvanometer shows a null deflection. The bridge then is balanced, and from the balance condition the value of the unknown resistance R 4 is given by,','[{"s": "The Wheatstone bridge and its balance condition provide a practical method for determination of an unknown resistance. Let us suppose we have an unknown resistance, which we insert in the fourth arm; R", "t": "text"}, {"s": "4", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is thus not known. Keeping known resistances R", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and R", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "in the first and second arm of the bridge, we go on varying R", "t": "text"}, {"s": "3", "t": "text"}, {"s": "till the galvanometer shows a null deflection. The bridge then is balanced, and from the balance condition the value of the unknown resistance R", "t": "text"}, {"s": "4", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is given by,", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(22521,57,405,'paragraph',NULL,'Current_Electricity-image30.png [3.83(b)]','[{"s": "Current_Electricity-image30.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "[3.83(b)]", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(22522,57,406,'paragraph',NULL,'A practical device using this principle is called the meter bridge. It will be discussed in the next section.','[{"s": "A practical device using this principle is called the meter bridge. It will be discussed in the next section.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
