(23032,58,288,'paragraph',NULL,'(a) Estimate the speed With Which electrons emitted from a heated emitter Of an evacuated tube impinge on the collector maintained at a potential difference Of 500 V With respect to the emitter. Ignore the small initial speeds Of the electrons. The specific charge of the electron, i.e., its e/ m is given to be 1.76 x 10 11 C kg -1 .','[{"s": "(a) Estimate the speed With Which electrons emitted from a heated emitter Of an evacuated tube impinge on the collector maintained at a potential difference Of 500 V With respect to the emitter. Ignore the small initial speeds Of the electrons. The specific charge of the electron, i.e., its e/ m is given to be", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1.76 x 10", "t": "text"}, {"s": "11", "t": "text"}, {"s": "C kg", "t": "text"}, {"s": "-1", "t": "text"}, {"s": ".", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
