(23047,58,303,'paragraph',NULL,'Estimating the following two numbers should be interesting. The first number will tell you why radio engineers do not need to worry much about photons! The second number tells you why our eye can never \'count photons\', even in barely detectable light.','[{"s": "Estimating the following two numbers should be interesting. The first number will tell you why radio engineers do not need to worry much about photons! The second number tells you why our eye can never \'count photons\', even in barely detectable light.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
