(23151,58,407,'paragraph',NULL,'Q. 15 (i) In the explanation of photoelectric effect, we assume one photon of frequency v collides with an electron and transfers its energy. This leads to the equation for the maximum energy Eng, of the emitted electron as','[{"s": "Q. 15 (i) In the explanation of photoelectric effect, we assume one photon of frequency v collides with an electron and transfers its energy. This leads to the equation for the maximum energy Eng, of the emitted electron as", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
