(23153,58,409,'paragraph',NULL,'where ϕ 0 is the work function of the metal. If an electron absorbs 2 photons (each of frequency v), what will be the maximum energy for the emitted electron?','[{"s": "where", "t": "text"}, {"s": "ϕ", "t": "text"}, {"s": "0", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is the work function of the metal. If an electron absorbs 2 photons (each of frequency v), what will be the maximum energy for the emitted electron?", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
