(23155,58,411,'paragraph',NULL,'Q. 16 There are materials which absorb photons of shorter wavelength and emit photons of longer wavelength. Can there be stable substances which absorb photons of larger wavelength and emit light of shorter wavelength.','[{"s": "Q. 16 There are materials which absorb photons of shorter wavelength and emit photons of longer wavelength. Can there be stable substances which absorb photons of larger wavelength and emit light of shorter wavelength.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
