(23339,59,161,'paragraph',NULL,'On account of the presence of the magnetic field, there will be a force on the arm PQ. This force I (l × B), is directed outwards in the direction opposite to the velocity of the rod. The magnitude of this force is,','[{"s": "On account of the presence of the magnetic field, there will be a force on the arm PQ. This force I (l × B), is directed outwards in the direction opposite to the velocity of the rod. The magnitude of this force is,", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
