(23345,59,167,'paragraph',NULL,'The agent that does this work is mechanical. Where does this mechanical energy go? The answer is: it is dissipated as Joule heat, and is given by','[{"s": "The agent that does this work is mechanical. Where does this mechanical energy go? The answer is: it is dissipated as Joule heat, and is given by", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
