(23350,59,172,'paragraph',NULL,'Thus, mechanical energy which was needed to move the arm PQ is converted into electrical energy (the induced emf) and then to thermal energy.','[{"s": "Thus, mechanical energy which was needed to move the arm PQ is converted into electrical energy (the induced emf) and then to thermal energy.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
