(23588,59,410,'paragraph',NULL,'(iii) When the rod was moving uniformly and the K was open, then on the electron in the rod PQ there was no net force even though they did not experience any magnetic field because of the motion of the rod. Explain.','[{"s": "(iii) When the rod was moving uniformly and the K was open, then on the electron in the rod PQ there was no net force even though they did not experience any magnetic field because of the motion of the rod. Explain.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
