(23701,60,49,'paragraph',NULL,'Consider now a circular loop of radius (1/2) m parallel to the plates passing through P. The magnetic field B at all points on the loop is along the loop and of the same value.','[{"s": "Consider now a circular loop of radius (1/2) m parallel to the plates passing through P. The magnetic field B at all points on the loop is along the loop and of the same value.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
