(23775,60,123,'paragraph',NULL,'Solution The bulb, as a point source, radiates light in all directions uniformly. At a distance of 3 m, the surface area of the surrounding sphere is','[{"s": "Solution The bulb, as a point source, radiates light in all directions uniformly. At a distance of 3 m, the surface area of the surrounding sphere is", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
