(23786,60,134,'paragraph',NULL,'Thus, you see that the electric field strength of the light that you use for reading is fairly large. Compare it with electric field strength of TV or FM waves, which is of the order of a few microvolts per metre.','[{"s": "Thus, you see that the electric field strength of the light that you use for reading is fairly large. Compare it with electric field strength of TV or FM waves, which is of the order of a few microvolts per metre.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(23787,60,135,'paragraph',NULL,'Now, let us calculate the strength of the magnetic field. It is','[{"s": "Now, let us calculate the strength of the magnetic field. It is", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
