(23885,60,233,'paragraph',NULL,'8.14 Given below are some famous numbers associated with electromagnetic radiations in different contexts in Physics. State the part of the electromagnetic spectrum to which each belongs.','[{"s": "8.14 Given below are some famous numbers associated with electromagnetic radiations in different contexts in Physics. State the part of the electromagnetic spectrum to which each belongs.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
