(24339,61,351,'paragraph',NULL,'For linear dielectrics, we expect σ p to be proportional to E 0 , i.e., to σ. Thus, (σ – σ p ) is proportional to σ and we can write','[{"s": "For linear dielectrics, we expect σ", "t": "text"}, {"s": "p", "t": "text"}, {"s": "to be proportional to E", "t": "text"}, {"s": "0", "t": "text"}, {"s": ", i.e., to σ. Thus, (σ – σ", "t": "text"}, {"s": "p", "t": "text"}, {"s": ") is proportional to σ and we can write", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
