(24506,61,518,'paragraph',NULL,'12. The energy U stored in a capacitor of capacitance C, with charge Q and voltage V is','[{"s": "12. The energy U stored in a capacitor of capacitance C, with charge Q and voltage V is", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
