(24655,61,667,'paragraph',NULL,'1. A capacitor of 4 uF is connected as shown in the circuit. The internal resistance of the battery is 0.5Q. The amount of charge on the capacitor plates will be','[{"s": "1. A capacitor of 4 uF is connected as shown in the circuit. The internal resistance of the battery is 0.5Q. The amount of charge on the capacitor plates will be", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
