(25098,62,348,'paragraph',NULL,'where M s is the mass of the Sun. Most planets have nearly circular orbits about the Sun. For elliptical orbits, the above equation is valid if R is replaced by the semi-major axis, a.','[{"s": "where M", "t": "text"}, {"s": "s", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is the mass of the Sun. Most planets have nearly circular orbits about the Sun. For elliptical orbits, the above equation is valid if R is replaced by the semi-major axis, a.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
