(25119,62,369,'paragraph',NULL,'and has a value of 11.2 km s –1 .','[{"s": "and has a value of 11.2 km s", "t": "text"}, {"s": "–1", "t": "text"}, {"s": ".", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(25104,62,354,'paragraph',NULL,'(b) at depth d below the earth’s surface is','[{"s": "(b) at depth d below the earth’s surface is", "t": "hl"}]','marked',NULL,NULL),
(25120,62,370,'paragraph',NULL,'9. If a particle is outside a uniform spherical shell or solid sphere with a spherically symmetric internal mass distribution, the sphere attracts the particle as though the mass of the sphere or shell were concentrated at the centre of the sphere.','[{"s": "9. If a particle is outside a uniform spherical shell or solid sphere with a spherically symmetric internal mass distribution, the sphere attracts the particle as though the mass of the sphere or shell were concentrated at the centre of the sphere.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(25121,62,371,'paragraph',NULL,'10. If a particle is inside a uniform spherical shell, the gravitational force on the particle is zero. If a particle is inside a homogeneous solid sphere, the force on the particle acts toward the centre of the sphere. This force is exerted by the spherical mass interior to the particle.','[{"s": "10. If a particle is inside a uniform spherical shell, the gravitational force on the particle is zero. If a particle is inside a homogeneous solid sphere, the force on the particle acts toward the centre of the sphere. This force is exerted by the spherical mass interior to the particle.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(25122,62,372,'paragraph',NULL,'11. A geostationary (geosynchronous communication) satellite moves in a circular orbit in the equatorial plane at a approximate distance of 4.22 × 10 4 km from the earth’s centre.','[{"s": "11. A geostationary (geosynchronous communication) satellite moves in a circular orbit in the equatorial plane at a approximate distance of 4.22 × 10", "t": "text"}, {"s": "4", "t": "text"}, {"s": "km from the earth’s centre.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
