(25742,64,182,'paragraph',NULL,'where F 1x , F 1y and F 1z are the components of F 1 along x , y and z directions respectively.','[{"s": "where", "t": "text"}, {"s": "F", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1x", "t": "text"}, {"s": ",", "t": "text"}, {"s": "F", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1y", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and", "t": "text"}, {"s": "F", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1z", "t": "text"}, {"s": "are the components of", "t": "text"}, {"s": "F", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "along", "t": "text"}, {"s": "x", "t": "text"}, {"s": ",", "t": "text"}, {"s": "y", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and", "t": "text"}, {"s": "z", "t": "text"}, {"s": "directions respectively.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(25743,64,183,'paragraph',NULL,'Example 5.6 See Fig. 5.8. A mass of 6 kg is suspended by a rope of length 2 m from the ceiling. A force of 50 N in the horizontal direction is applied at the mid-point P of the rope, as shown. What is the angle the rope makes with the vertical in equilibrium ? (Take g = 10 m s -2 ). Neglect the mass of the rope.','[{"s": "Example 5.6", "t": "text"}, {"s": "See Fig. 5.8. A mass of 6 kg is suspended by a rope of length 2 m from the ceiling. A force of 50 N in the horizontal direction is applied at the mid-point P of the rope, as shown. What is the angle the rope makes with the vertical in equilibrium ? (Take g = 10 m s", "t": "text"}, {"s": "-2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "). Neglect the mass of the rope.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
