(25798,64,238,'paragraph',NULL,'Answer As the string is inextensible, and the pully is smooth, the 3 kg block and the 20 kg trolley both have same magnitude of acceleration. Applying second law to motion of the block (Fig. 5.12(b)),','[{"s": "Answer", "t": "text"}, {"s": "As the string is inextensible, and the pully is smooth, the 3 kg block and the 20 kg trolley both have same magnitude of acceleration. Applying second law to motion of the block (Fig. 5.12(b)),", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
