(26987,66,557,'paragraph',NULL,'Q. 14 vessel filled with water is kept on a weighing pan and the scale adjusted to zero. A block of mass M and density ρ is suspended by a massless spring of spring constant k. This block is submerged inside into the water in the vessel. What is the reading of the scale?','[{"s": "Q. 14 vessel filled with water is kept on a weighing pan and the scale adjusted to zero. A block of mass M and density", "t": "text"}, {"s": "ρ", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is suspended by a massless spring of spring constant k. This block is submerged inside into the water in the vessel. What is the reading of the scale?", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
