(26989,66,559,'paragraph',NULL,'The surface tension of sap is T=7.28 ×10 −2 Nm −1 and the angle of contact is 0° . Does surface tension alone account for the supply of water to the top of all trees?','[{"s": "The surface tension of sap is T=7.28", "t": "text"}, {"s": "×10", "t": "text"}, {"s": "−2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Nm", "t": "text"}, {"s": "−1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and the angle of contact is", "t": "text"}, {"s": "0°", "t": "text"}, {"s": ". Does surface tension alone account for the supply of water to the top of all trees?", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
