(27385,68,92,'paragraph',NULL,'This is represented in Fig. 4.9(c). The quantities A x and A y are called x-, and y- components of the vector A . Note that A x is itself not a vector, but','[{"s": "This is represented in Fig. 4.9(c). The quantities A", "t": "text"}, {"s": "x", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and A", "t": "text"}, {"s": "y", "t": "text"}, {"s": "are called x-, and y- components of the vector", "t": "text"}, {"s": "A", "t": "text"}, {"s": ". Note that A", "t": "text"}, {"s": "x", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is itself not a vector, but", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
