(27388,68,95,'paragraph',NULL,'. Using simple trigonometry, we can express A x and A y in terms of the magnitude of A and the angle θ it makes with the x-axis :','[{"s": ". Using simple trigonometry, we can express A", "t": "text"}, {"s": "x", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and A", "t": "text"}, {"s": "y", "t": "text"}, {"s": "in terms of the magnitude of", "t": "text"}, {"s": "A", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and the angle θ it makes with the x-axis :", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
