(27395,68,102,'paragraph',NULL,'If A and θ are given, A x and A y can be obtained using Eq. (4.13). If A x and A y are given, A and θ can be obtained as follows :','[{"s": "If A and θ are given, A", "t": "text"}, {"s": "x", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and A", "t": "text"}, {"s": "y", "t": "text"}, {"s": "can be obtained using Eq. (4.13). If A", "t": "text"}, {"s": "x", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and A", "t": "text"}, {"s": "y", "t": "text"}, {"s": "are given, A and θ can be obtained as follows :", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
