(27403,68,110,'paragraph',NULL,'So far we have considered a vector lying in an x-y plane. The same procedure can be used to resolve a general vector A into three components along x-, y-, and z-axes in three dimensions. If α, β, and γ are the angles* between A and the x-, y-, and z-axes, respectively [Fig. 4.9(d)], we have','[{"s": "So far we have considered a vector lying in an x-y plane. The same procedure can be used to resolve a general vector", "t": "text"}, {"s": "A", "t": "text"}, {"s": "into three components along x-, y-, and z-axes in three dimensions. If α, β, and γ are the angles* between", "t": "text"}, {"s": "A", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and the x-, y-, and z-axes, respectively [Fig. 4.9(d)], we have", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
