(27499,68,206,'paragraph',NULL,'where x and y are components of r along x-, and y- axes or simply they are the coordinates of the object.','[{"s": "where x and y are components of", "t": "text"}, {"s": "r", "t": "text"}, {"s": "along x-, and y- axes or simply they are the coordinates of the object.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
