(27518,68,225,'paragraph',NULL,', the direction of the average velocity is the same as that of ∆ r (Fig. 4.12). The velocity(instantaneous velocity) is given by the limiting value of the average velocity as the time interval approaches zero :','[{"s": ", the direction of the average velocity is the same as that of ∆", "t": "text"}, {"s": "r", "t": "text"}, {"s": "(Fig. 4.12). The velocity(instantaneous velocity) is given by the limiting value of the average velocity as the time interval approaches zero :", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
