(28002,69,145,'paragraph',NULL,'Equations (3.9a) and (3.9b) mean that the object has undergone displacement x with an average velocity equal to the arithmetic average of the initial and final velocities.','[{"s": "Equations (3.9a) and (3.9b) mean that the object has undergone displacement", "t": "text"}, {"s": "x", "t": "text"}, {"s": "with an average velocity equal to the arithmetic average of the initial and final velocities.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(28003,69,146,'paragraph',NULL,'From Eq. (3.6), t = ( v – v 0 ) /a . Substituting this in Eq. (3.9a), we get','[{"s": "From Eq. (3.6),", "t": "text"}, {"s": "t =", "t": "text"}, {"s": "(", "t": "text"}, {"s": "v – v", "t": "text"}, {"s": "0", "t": "text"}, {"s": ")", "t": "text"}, {"s": "/a", "t": "text"}, {"s": ". Substituting this in Eq. (3.9a), we get", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
