(28061,69,204,'paragraph',NULL,'This is the time in going from A to B . From B , or the point of the maximum height, the ball falls freely under the acceleration due to gravity. The ball is moving in negative y direction. We use equation','[{"s": "This is the time in going from", "t": "text"}, {"s": "A", "t": "text"}, {"s": "to", "t": "text"}, {"s": "B", "t": "text"}, {"s": ". From", "t": "text"}, {"s": "B", "t": "text"}, {"s": ", or the point of the maximum height, the ball falls freely under the acceleration due to gravity. The ball is moving in negative", "t": "text"}, {"s": "y", "t": "text"}, {"s": "direction. We use equation", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
