(28238,70,58,'paragraph',NULL,'Note that it would have been sufficient to specify m/l, the mass per unit length of the wire. The earth’s magnetic field is approximately 4 × 10 –5 T and we have ignored it.','[{"s": "Note that it would have been sufficient to specify m/l, the mass per unit length of the wire. The earth’s magnetic field is approximately 4 × 10", "t": "text"}, {"s": "–5", "t": "text"}, {"s": "T and we have ignored it.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
