(29213,71,346,'paragraph',NULL,'13.1 (a) Two stable isotopes of lithium Nuclei-image95.png and Nuclei-image32.png have respective abundances of 7.5% and 92.5%. These isotopes have masses 6.01512 u and 7.01600 u, respectively. Find the atomic mass of lithium.','[{"s": "13.1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "(a) Two stable isotopes of lithium", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Nuclei-image95.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "and", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Nuclei-image32.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "have respective abundances of 7.5% and 92.5%. These isotopes have masses 6.01512 u and 7.01600 u, respectively. Find the atomic mass of lithium.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(29214,71,347,'paragraph',NULL,'(b) Boron has two stable isotopes, Nuclei-image3.png and Nuclei-image126.png . Their respective masses are 10.01294 u and 11.00931 u, and the atomic mass of boron is 10.811 u. Find the abundances of Nuclei-image107.png and Nuclei-image42.png .','[{"s": "(b) Boron has two stable isotopes,", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Nuclei-image3.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "and", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Nuclei-image126.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": ". Their respective masses are 10.01294 u and 11.00931 u, and the atomic mass of boron is 10.811 u. Find the abundances of", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Nuclei-image107.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "and", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Nuclei-image42.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": ".", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(29215,71,348,'paragraph',NULL,'13.2 The three stable isotopes of neon: Nuclei-image129.png have respective abundances of 90.51%, 0.27% and 9.22%. The atomic masses of the three isotopes are 19.99 u, 20.99 u and 21.99 u, respectively. Obtain the average atomic mass of neon.','[{"s": "13.2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "The three stable isotopes of neon:", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Nuclei-image129.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "have respective abundances of 90.51%, 0.27% and 9.22%. The atomic masses of the three isotopes are 19.99 u, 20.99 u and 21.99 u, respectively. Obtain the average atomic mass of neon.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
