(29626,72,234,'paragraph',NULL,'It follows from Eqs. (14.15) and (14.17) that the total energy, E, of the system is,','[{"s": "It follows from Eqs. (14.15) and (14.17) that the total energy, E, of the system is,", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
