(29713,72,321,'paragraph',NULL,'Fig. 14.17 A linear simple harmonic oscillator consisting of a block of mass m attached to a spring. The block moves over a frictionless surface. The box, when pulled or pushed and released, executes simple harmonic motion.','[{"s": "Fig. 14.17 A linear simple harmonic oscillator consisting of a block of mass m attached to a spring. The block moves over a frictionless surface. The box, when pulled or pushed and released, executes simple harmonic motion.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
