(29750,72,358,'paragraph',NULL,'The solution of Eq. (14.32) describes the motion of the block under the influence of a damping force which is proportional to velocity. The solution is found to be of the form','[{"s": "The solution of Eq. (14.32) describes the motion of the block under the influence of a damping force which is proportional to velocity. The solution is found to be of the form", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
