(29879,72,487,'paragraph',NULL,'14.5 A particle is in linear simple harmonic motion between two points, A and B, 10 cm apart. Take the direction from A to B as the positive direction and give the signs of velocity, acceleration and force on the particle when it is','[{"s": "14.5", "t": "text"}, {"s": "A particle is in linear simple harmonic motion between two points, A and B, 10 cm apart. Take the direction from A to B as the positive direction and give the signs of velocity, acceleration and force on the particle when it is", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
