(29886,72,494,'paragraph',NULL,'14.6 Which of the following relationships between the acceleration a and the displacement x of a particle involve simple harmonic motion?','[{"s": "14.6", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Which of the following relationships between the acceleration a and the displacement x of a particle involve simple harmonic motion?", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
