(29901,72,509,'paragraph',NULL,'14.11 Figures 14.25 correspond to two circular motions. The radius of the circle, the period of revolution, the initial position, and the sense of revolution (i.e. clockwise or anti-clockwise) are indicated on each figure.','[{"s": "14.11", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Figures 14.25 correspond to two circular motions. The radius of the circle, the period of revolution, the initial position, and the sense of revolution (i.e. clockwise or anti-clockwise) are indicated on each figure.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
