(29979,73,37,'paragraph',NULL,'Now, for small θ, the point D is very close to the point P. Therefore, FD = f and CD = R. Equation (9.2) then gives','[{"s": "Now, for small θ, the point D is very close to the point P. Therefore, FD =", "t": "text"}, {"s": "f", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and CD =", "t": "text"}, {"s": "R.", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Equation (9.2) then gives", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
