(30134,73,192,'paragraph',NULL,'Here, OM, MI and MC represent magnitudes of distances. Applying the Cartesian sign convention,','[{"s": "Here, OM, MI and MC represent magnitudes of distances. Applying the Cartesian sign convention,", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
