(30227,73,285,'paragraph',NULL,'This gives n = 1.5.','[{"s": "This gives n = 1.5.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30228,73,286,'paragraph',NULL,'(iii) For a glass lens in air, n 2 = 1.5, n 1 = 1, f = +20 cm. Hence, the lens formula gives','[{"s": "(iii) For a glass lens in air, n", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "= 1.5, n", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "= 1, f = +20 cm. Hence, the lens formula gives", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
