(30286,73,344,'paragraph',NULL,'A plot between the angle of deviation and angle of incidence is shown in Fig. 9.24. You can see that, in general, any given value of δ, except for i = e , corresponds to two values i and hence of e . This, in fact, is expected from the symmetry of i and e in Eq. (9.35), i.e., δ remains the same if i and e are interchanged. Physically, this is related to the fact that the path of ray in Fig. 9.23 can be traced back, resulting in the same angle of deviation. At the minimum deviation D m , the refracted ray inside the prism becomes parallel to its base. We have','[{"s": "A plot between the angle of deviation and angle of incidence is shown in Fig. 9.24. You can see that, in general, any given value of δ, except for", "t": "text"}, {"s": "i", "t": "text"}, {"s": "=", "t": "text"}, {"s": "e", "t": "text"}, {"s": ", corresponds to two values", "t": "text"}, {"s": "i", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and hence of", "t": "text"}, {"s": "e", "t": "text"}, {"s": ". This, in fact, is expected from the symmetry of", "t": "text"}, {"s": "i", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and", "t": "text"}, {"s": "e", "t": "text"}, {"s": "in Eq. (9.35), i.e., δ remains the same if", "t": "text"}, {"s": "i", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and", "t": "text"}, {"s": "e", "t": "text"}, {"s": "are interchanged. Physically, this is related to the fact that the path of ray in Fig. 9.23 can be traced back, resulting in the same angle of deviation. At the minimum deviation", "t": "text"}, {"s": "D", "t": "text"}, {"s": "m", "t": "text"}, {"s": ", the refracted ray inside the prism becomes parallel to its base. We have", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(30287,73,345,'paragraph',NULL,'δ = D m , i = e which implies r 1 = r 2 .','[{"s": "δ =", "t": "text"}, {"s": "D", "t": "text"}, {"s": "m", "t": "text"}, {"s": ",", "t": "text"}, {"s": "i", "t": "text"}, {"s": "=", "t": "text"}, {"s": "e", "t": "text"}, {"s": "which implies", "t": "text"}, {"s": "r", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "=", "t": "text"}, {"s": "r", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": ".", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
