(30563,73,621,'paragraph',NULL,'9.10 A car is moving with at a constant speed of 60 km h -1 on a straight road. Looking at the rearview mirror, the driver finds that the car following him is at a distance of 100 m and is approaching with a speed of 5km h -1','[{"s": "9.10", "t": "text"}, {"s": "A car is moving with at a constant speed of 60 km h", "t": "text"}, {"s": "-1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "on a straight road. Looking at the rearview mirror, the driver finds that the car following him is at a distance of 100 m and is approaching with a speed of 5km h", "t": "text"}, {"s": "-1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "", "t": "br"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
