(30575,73,633,'paragraph',NULL,'2. the angle subtended by the image of the object at the eye is smaller than the actual angle subtended by the object in air','[{"s": "2. the angle subtended by the image of the object at the eye is smaller than the actual angle subtended by the object in air", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
