(30788,74,166,'paragraph',NULL,'In the section, we shall discuss some devices which are basically junction diodes but are developed for different applications.','[{"s": "In the section, we shall discuss some devices which are basically junction diodes but are developed for different applications.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
