(31488,75,154,'paragraph',NULL,'where Systems_Of_Particles-image69.png is the velocity of the first particle Systems_Of_Particles-image277.png is the velocity of the second particle etc. and Systems_Of_Particles-image26.png is the velocity of the centre of mass. Note that we assumed the masses m 1 , m 2 , ... etc. do not change in time. We have therefore, treated them as constants in differentiating the equations with respect to time.','[{"s": "where", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Systems_Of_Particles-image69.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "is the velocity of the first particle", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Systems_Of_Particles-image277.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "is the velocity of the second particle etc. and", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Systems_Of_Particles-image26.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "is the velocity of the centre of mass. Note that we assumed the masses m", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1", "t": "text"}, {"s": ", m", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": ", ... etc. do not change in time. We have therefore, treated them as constants in differentiating the equations with respect to time.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(31489,75,155,'paragraph',NULL,'Differentiating Eq.(7.8) with respect to time, we obtain','[{"s": "Differentiating Eq.(7.8) with respect to time, we obtain", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
