(31494,75,160,'paragraph',NULL,'where Systems_Of_Particles-image60.png is the acceleration of the first particle, Systems_Of_Particles-image193.png is the acceleration of the second particle etc. and Systems_Of_Particles-image173.png is the acceleration of the centre of mass of the system of particles.','[{"s": "where", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Systems_Of_Particles-image60.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "is the acceleration of the first particle,", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Systems_Of_Particles-image193.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "is the acceleration of the second particle etc. and", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Systems_Of_Particles-image173.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "is the acceleration of the centre of mass of the system of particles.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(31495,75,161,'paragraph',NULL,'Now, from Newton’s second law, the force acting on the first particle is given by Systems_Of_Particles-image120.png . The force acting on the second particle is given by Systems_Of_Particles-image205.png and so on. Eq. (7.9) may be written as','[{"s": "Now, from Newton’s second law, the force acting on the first particle is given by", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Systems_Of_Particles-image120.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": ". The force acting on the second particle is given by", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Systems_Of_Particles-image205.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "and so on. Eq. (7.9) may be written as", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
