(32275,75,941,'paragraph',NULL,'7.19 A hoop of radius 2 m weighs 100 kg. It rolls along a horizontal floor so that its centre of mass has a speed of 20 cm/s. How much work has to be done to stop it?','[{"s": "7.19", "t": "text"}, {"s": "A hoop of radius 2 m weighs 100 kg. It rolls along a horizontal floor so that its centre of mass has a speed of 20 cm/s. How much work has to be done to stop it?", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
