(32309,75,975,'paragraph',NULL,'(a) During rolling, the force of friction acts in the same direction as the direction of motion of the CM of the body.','[{"s": "(a) During rolling, the force of friction acts in the same direction as the direction of motion of the CM of the body.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
