(32319,75,985,'paragraph',NULL,'where K is the total kinetic energy of the system of particles, Systems_Of_Particles-image195.png is the total kinetic energy of the system when the particle velocities are taken with respect to the centre of mass and MV 2 /2 is the kinetic energy of the translation of the system as a whole (i.e. of the centre of mass motion of the system). The result has been used in Sec. 7.14.','[{"s": "where K is the total kinetic energy of the system of particles,", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Systems_Of_Particles-image195.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "is the total kinetic energy of the system when the particle velocities are taken with respect to the centre of mass and MV", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "/2 is the kinetic energy of the translation of the system as a whole (i.e. of the centre of mass motion of the system). The result has been used in Sec. 7.14.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
