(32386,75,1052,'paragraph',NULL,'Where K is the total kinetic energy of the system of particles, K′ is the total kinetic energy of the system when the particle velocities are taken with respect to the center of mass and MV2/2 is the kinetic energy of the translation of the system as a whole (i.e. of the center of mass motion of the system). The result has been used in Sec. 7.14.','[{"s": "Where K is the total kinetic energy of the system of particles, K′ is the total kinetic energy of the system when the particle velocities are taken with respect to the center of mass and MV2/2 is the kinetic energy of the translation of the system as a whole (i.e. of the center of mass motion of the system). The result has been used in Sec. 7.14.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
