(33244,77,223,'paragraph',NULL,'Heat released (Q2) by the gas to the reservoir at temperature T2 is given by Eq. (12.12). This is also the work done (W3 → 4) on the gas by the environment.','[{"s": "Heat released (Q2) by the gas to the reservoir at temperature T2 is given by Eq. (12.12). This is also the work done (W3 → 4) on the gas by the environment.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
