(33249,77,228,'paragraph',NULL,'From Eqs. (12.23) to (12.26) total work done by the gas in one complete cycle is','[{"s": "From Eqs. (12.23) to (12.26) total work done by the gas in one complete cycle is", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
