(33281,77,260,'paragraph',NULL,'where m is the mass of the substance and ∆Q is the heat required to change its temperature by ∆T. The molar specific heat capacity of a substance is defined by','[{"s": "where m is the mass of the substance and ∆Q is the heat required to change its temperature by ∆T. The molar specific heat capacity of a substance is defined by", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
