(33299,77,278,'paragraph',NULL,'10. Heat engine is a device in which a system undergoes a cyclic process resulting in conversion of heat into work. If Q1 is the heat absorbed from the source, Q2 is the heat released to the sink, and the work output in one cycle is W, the efficiency η of the engine is:','[{"s": "10. Heat engine is a device in which a system undergoes a cyclic process resulting in conversion of heat into work. If Q1 is the heat absorbed from the source, Q2 is the heat released to the sink, and the work output in one cycle is W, the efficiency η of the engine is:", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
