(34255,79,175,'paragraph',NULL,'Thus if we replace S 2 P + S 1 P by 2 D , the error involved is about 0.005%. In this approximation, Eq. (10.16) becomes','[{"s": "Thus if we replace S", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "P + S", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "P by 2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "D", "t": "text"}, {"s": ", the error involved is about 0.005%. In this approximation, Eq. (10.16) becomes", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
