(34511,79,431,'paragraph',NULL,'Q. 5 Figure shows a standard two-slit arrangement with slits S 1 ,S 2 ,P 1 ,P 2 are the two minima points on either side of P (figure).','[{"s": "Q. 5 Figure shows a standard two-slit arrangement with slits", "t": "text"}, {"s": "S", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1", "t": "text"}, {"s": ",S", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": ",P", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1", "t": "text"}, {"s": ",P", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "are the two minima points on either side of P (figure).", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
