(34519,79,439,'paragraph',NULL,'Q.6 Two Sources S 1 and S 2 of intensity I 1 and l 2 are front of a screen [Fig.(a)]. The pattern of intensity distribution seen in the central potion i given by Fig.(b).','[{"s": "Q.6 Two Sources", "t": "text"}, {"s": "S", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and S", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "of intensity", "t": "text"}, {"s": "I", "t": "text"}, {"s": "1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and l", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "are front of a screen [Fig.(a)]. The pattern of intensity distribution seen in the central potion i given by Fig.(b).", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
