(34548,79,468,'paragraph',NULL,'Q. 21 Four identical monochromatic sources A, B, C, D as shown in the (figure) produce waves of the same wavelength λ , and are coherent. Two receiver, and R, are at great but equal distances from B. (i) Which of the two receivers picks up the larger signal?','[{"s": "Q. 21 Four identical monochromatic sources A, B, C, D as shown in the (figure) produce waves of the same wavelength", "t": "text"}, {"s": "λ", "t": "text"}, {"s": ", and are coherent. Two receiver, and R, are at great but equal distances from B. (i) Which of the two receivers picks up the larger signal?", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
