(34564,79,484,'paragraph',NULL,'Q.15 A polaroid (1) is placed infront of a monochromatic source. Another polaroid (II) is placed in front of this polaroid (I) and rotated till no light passes. A third polaroid (III) is now placed in between (II) and (II). In this case, wil light emerge from (II). Explain.','[{"s": "Q.15 A polaroid (1) is placed infront of a monochromatic source. Another polaroid (II) is placed in front of this polaroid (I) and rotated till no light passes. A third polaroid (III) is now placed in between (II) and (II). In this case, wil light emerge from (II). Explain.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
