(34655,80,88,'paragraph',NULL,'Now, the period of oscillation of the wave is the time it takes for an element to complete one full oscillation. That is','[{"s": "Now, the period of oscillation of the wave is the time it takes for an element to complete one full oscillation. That is", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
