(34660,80,93,'paragraph',NULL,'Waves-image48.png is called the angular frequency of the wave. Its SI unit is rad s –1 . The frequency ν is the number of oscillations per second. Therefore,','[{"s": "Waves-image48.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "is called the angular frequency of the wave. Its SI unit is rad s", "t": "text"}, {"s": "–1", "t": "text"}, {"s": ". The frequency ν is the number of oscillations per second. Therefore,", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
