(34752,80,185,'paragraph',NULL,'Therefore, from Eq. (15.19) the speed of a longitudinal wave in an ideal gas is given by,','[{"s": "Therefore, from Eq. (15.19) the speed of a longitudinal wave in an ideal gas is given by,", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
