(34863,80,296,'paragraph',NULL,'The fundamental frequency corresponds to n = 0, and is given by v/4L . The higher frequencies are odd harmonics, i.e., odd multiples of the fundamental frequency : 3 v/4L , 5v/4L , etc.','[{"s": "The fundamental frequency corresponds to n = 0, and is given by v/4L . The higher frequencies are odd harmonics, i.e., odd multiples of the fundamental frequency :", "t": "text"}, {"s": "3", "t": "text"}, {"s": "v/4L", "t": "text"}, {"s": ",", "t": "text"}, {"s": "5v/4L", "t": "text"}, {"s": ",", "t": "text"}, {"s": "etc.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
