(34867,80,300,'paragraph',NULL,'Fig. 15.14 shows the first six odd harmonics of air column with one end closed and the other open. For a pipe open at both ends, each end is an antinode. It is then easily seen that an open air column at both ends generates all harmonics (See Fig. 15.15).','[{"s": "", "t": "br"}, {"s": "Fig. 15.14 shows the first six odd harmonics of air column with one end closed and the other open. For a pipe open at both ends, each end is an antinode. It is then easily seen that an open air column at both ends generates all harmonics (See Fig. 15.15).", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
