(34936,80,369,'paragraph',NULL,'If v s is small compared with the wave speed v, taking binomial expansion to terms in first order in vs/v and neglecting higher power, Eq. (15.50) may be approximated, giving','[{"s": "If v", "t": "text"}, {"s": "s", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is small compared with the wave speed v, taking binomial expansion to terms in first order in vs/v and neglecting higher power, Eq. (15.50) may be approximated, giving", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
