(34949,80,382,'paragraph',NULL,'If Waves-image52.png is small, the Doppler shift is almost same whether it is the observer or the source moving since Eq. (15.53) and the approximate relation Eq. (15.51 ) are the same.','[{"s": "If", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Waves-image52.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "is small, the Doppler shift is almost same whether it is the observer or the source moving since Eq. (15.53) and the approximate relation Eq. (15.51 ) are the same.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
