(35248,81,11,'paragraph',NULL,'Fig. 6.1 (a) The scalar product of two vectors A and B is a scalar : A.B = A B cos θ. (b) Bcos θ is the projection of B onto A. (c) A cos θ is the projection of A onto B.','[{"s": "Fig. 6.1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "(a) The scalar product of two vectors A and B is a scalar : A.B = A B cos θ. (b) Bcos θ is the projection of B onto A. (c) A cos θ is the projection of A onto B.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(35249,81,12,'paragraph',NULL,'Equation (6.1a) shows that the scalar product follows the commutative law :','[{"s": "Equation (6.1a) shows that the scalar product follows the commutative law :", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
