(35428,81,191,'paragraph',NULL,'Work_Energy_and_Power-image10.png irrespective of the angle of inclination. Thus, at the bottom of the inclined plane it acquires a kinetic energy, mgh. If the work done or the kinetic energy did depend on other factors such as the velocity or the particular path taken by the object, the force would be called non-conservative.','[{"s": "Work_Energy_and_Power-image10.png", "t": "img", "alt": "Screen Shot 2019-06-09 at 3.02.56 PM"}, {"s": "irrespective of the angle of inclination. Thus, at the bottom of the inclined plane it acquires a kinetic energy, mgh. If the work done or the kinetic energy did depend on other factors such as the velocity or the particular path taken by the object, the force would be called non-conservative.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
