(3394,29,75,'paragraph',NULL,'Let us now look at another aspect of respiration. As you know, during aerobic respiration, O 2 is consumed and CO 2 is released. The ratio of the volume of CO 2 evolved to the volume of O 2 consumed in respiration is called the respiratory quotient (RQ) or respiratory ratio.','[{"s": "Let us now look at another aspect of respiration. As you know, during aerobic respiration, O", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is consumed and CO", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is released.", "t": "text"}, {"s": "The ratio of the volume of CO", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "2", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "evolved to the volume of O", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "2", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "consumed in respiration is called the respiratory quotient (RQ) or respiratory ratio.", "t": "hl"}]','marked','["141216"]',NULL),
