(2952,26,83,'paragraph',NULL,'2. On the other extreme, is the type wherein the diploid sporophyte is the dominant, photosynthetic, independent phase of the plant. The gametophytic phase is represented by the single to few-celled haploid gametophyte. This kind of life cycle is termed as diplontic. An alga, Fucus sp., represents this pattern (Fig. 3.7b). In addition, all seed bearing plants i.e., gymnosperms and angiosperms, follow this pattern with some variations, wherein, the gametophytic phase is few to multi-celled.','[{"s": "2. On the other extreme, is the type wherein the diploid sporophyte is the dominant, photosynthetic, independent phase of the plant. The gametophytic phase is represented by the single to few-celled haploid gametophyte.", "t": "text"}, {"s": "This kind of life cycle is termed as diplontic.", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "An alga, Fucus sp., represents this pattern (Fig. 3.7b).", "t": "text"}, {"s": "In addition, all seed bearing plants i.e., gymnosperms and angiosperms, follow this pattern with some variations, wherein, the gametophytic phase is few to multi-celled.", "t": "hl"}]','marked',NULL,NULL),
(31952,75,618,'paragraph',NULL,'The moment of inertia of a body about any axis is equal to the sum of the moment of inertia of the body about a parallel axis passing through its centre of mass and the product of its mass and the square of the distance between the two parallel axes.2 As shown in the Fig. 7.31, z and z′ are two parallel axes, separated by a distance a. The z-axis passes through the centre of mass O of the rigid body. Then according to the theorem of parallel axes','[{"s": "The moment of inertia of a body about any axis is equal to the sum of the moment of inertia of the body about a parallel axis passing through its centre of mass and the product of its mass and the square of the distance between the two parallel axes.2", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "As shown in the Fig. 7.31, z and z′ are two parallel axes, separated by a distance a. The z-axis passes through the centre of mass O of the rigid body.", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Then according to the theorem of parallel axes", "t": "hl"}]','marked',NULL,NULL),
