(32222,75,888,'paragraph',NULL,'7. The centre of gravity of a body coincides with its centre of mass only if the gravitational field does not vary from one part of the body to the other.','[{"s": "7.", "t": "text"}, {"s": "The centre of gravity of a body coincides with its centre of mass only if the gravitational field does not vary from one part of the body to the other.", "t": "hl"}]','marked',NULL,NULL),
