(2672,24,74,'paragraph',NULL,'(a) Since splitting of the water molecule takes place on the inner side of the membrane, the protons or hydrogen ions that are produced by the splitting of water accumulate within the lumen of the thylakoids.','[{"s": "(a) Since splitting of the water molecule takes place on the inner side of the membrane, the protons or hydrogen ions that are produced by the splitting of water accumulate within the lumen of the thylakoids.", "t": "hl"}]','marked',NULL,NULL),
(3462,30,55,'paragraph',NULL,'There is a characteristic distribution of the cells within the embryo sac. Three cells are grouped together at the micropylar end and constitute the egg apparatus . The egg apparatus, in turn, consists of two synergids and one egg cell . The synergids have special cellular thickenings at the micropylar tip called filiform apparatus, which play an important role in guiding the pollen tubes into the synergid . Three cells are at the chalazal end and are called the antipodals . The large central cell, as mentioned earlier, has two polar nuclei. Thus, a typical angiosperm embryo sac, at maturity, though 8-nucleate is 7-celled.','[{"s": "There is a characteristic distribution of the cells within the embryo sac.", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Three cells are grouped together at the micropylar end and constitute the", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "egg apparatus", "t": "hl"}, {"s": ".", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "The egg apparatus, in turn, consists of two", "t": "text"}, {"s": "synergids", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and one", "t": "text"}, {"s": "egg cell", "t": "text"}, {"s": ".", "t": "text"}, {"s": "The synergids have special cellular thickenings at the micropylar tip called filiform apparatus, which play an important role in guiding the pollen tubes into the", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "synergid", "t": "hl"}, {"s": ". Three cells are at the chalazal end and are called the", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "antipodals", "t": "hl"}, {"s": ".", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "The large central cell, as mentioned earlier, has two polar nuclei.", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Thus, a typical angiosperm embryo sac, at maturity, though", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "8-nucleate", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "is", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "7-celled.", "t": "hl"}]','marked','["240618", "241519", "241639", "241644"]',NULL),
