(200319,'chemistry','The chemical composition of the slag formed during smelting is ?','FeSiO₃','FeO + SiO₂ → FeSiO₃(slag)  (Reference: NCERT class 12 , unit 6 , page 156 paragraph 2)','Inorganic chemistry >> General principles and processes of isolation of Elements >> Extraction of crude metals from concentrated ore',NULL,'2','mcq','CuSiO₃','FeSiO₃','CaSiO₃','Cu₂O.SiO₂','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
