(211111,'biology','The space between the ____ and the _____ is called the aqueous chamber.','Cornea, lens','The space between the cornea and the lens is called the aqueous chamber..(Reference  : NCERT biology class 11; page 324;paragraph no.5)','Human Physiology >> Neural Control and Coordination >> The Eye 2','Neural Control and Coordination','3','mcq','Cornea, iris','Cornea, lens','Lens, Iris','Iris,lens','OLD','11-324',NULL,NULL),
(211112,'biology','The space between the _____ and the _____ is called the vitreous chamber.','Lens, retina','The space between the lens and the retina is called the vitreous chamber. .(Reference  : NCERT biology class 11; page 324;paragraph no.5)','Human Physiology >> Neural Control and Coordination >> The Eye 2','Neural Control and Coordination','3','mcq','Lens, iris','Cornea, retina','Cornea, Iris','Lens, retina','OLD','11-324',NULL,NULL),
