(211115,'biology','_____ generate potentials (impulses) in rods and cones.','Visible light rays focused by the cornea and the lens','The light rays in visible wavelength focussed on the retina through the cornea and lens generate potentials (impulses) in rods and cones .(Reference  : NCERT biology class 11; page 324;paragraph no.6)','Human Physiology >> Neural Control and Coordination >> The Eye 2','Neural Control and Coordination','2','mcq','Visible light rays focused by the cornea and the lens','UV rays focused through the aqueous and vitreous','Infra red rays focused through the cornea and lens','Visible light focused through the aqueous and vitreous','OLD','11-324',NULL,NULL),
