(180103,'chemistry','Branch of chemistry deals with the study of reaction rates and their mechanism','Chemical Kinetics','Chemical kinetics deals with study of reaction rates and their mechanism.(Reference:  NCERT 12th chemistry ; Page 95 ; Paragraph 5)','Physical chemistry >> Chemical kinetics >> Introduction',NULL,'1','mcq','Thermodynamics','Chemical Kinetics','Redox','Equilibrium','NEW','12-095','12-061',NULL),
