(180322,'biology','Which of the following is a B lymphocyte in the diagram ? (1804)','d','(Reference  : NCERT Biology Class 11; Page 279; Figure 18.1)','Human Physiology >> Body Fluids and circulation >> Formed elements','Body fluids and circulation','2','mcq','a','b','c','d','NEW','11-279','11-194','/ncert/pyq/biology/mcq/180322q.png'),
