(180709,'chemistry','Assertion In Maxwell Boltzmann distribution curve at (t+10), the area showing the fraction of molecules having energy equal to or greater than activation energy gets doubled.                                                                                                                                                               Reason: Increasing the temperature of the substance increases the fraction of molecules, which collide with energies greater than Ea.','Both assertion and reason are true and reason is a correct explanation of the assertion.','(Reference NCERT Class 12; Page 114; Paragraph 2)','Physical chemistry >> Chemical kinetics >> Temperature dependence of the rate of a reaction',NULL,'3','mcq','Both assertion and reason are true and reason is a correct explanation of the assertion.','Both assertion and reason are true but reason is not a correct explanation of the assertion.','Assertion is true. Reason is false.','Both assertion and reason are false.','NEW','12-114','12-080',NULL),
