(250140,'biology','Highly coiled seminiferous tubules are present in:','Testicular lobules','Highly coiled seminiferous tubules are present in testicular lobules. Reference  : NCERT Page 44','Reproduction >> Human Reproduction >> The Male Reproductive System 1',NULL,'1','mcq','Testicular lacuna','Testicular lobules','Rete Testis','Interstitial space','NEW','12-044','12-028',NULL),
(250141,'biology','Each testicular lobule contains ________ highly coiled seminiferous tubules.','1 to 3','Each lobule contains one to three highly coiled seminiferous tubules in which sperms are produced Reference  : NCERT Page 44','Reproduction >> Human Reproduction >> The Male Reproductive System 1',NULL,'2','mcq','2 to 5','1 to 3','2 to 4','3 to 5','NEW','12-044','12-028',NULL),
(250142,'biology','Each seminiferous tubule is lined on its inside by two types of cells called:','Male germ cells and Sertoli cells','Each seminiferous tubule is lined on its inside by two types of cells called male germ cells (spermatogonia) and Sertoli cells Reference  : NCERT Page 44','Reproduction >> Human Reproduction >> The Male Reproductive System 1',NULL,'2','mcq','Male germ cells and interstitial cells','Male germ cells and Sertoli cells','Leydig cells and Sertoli cells','Male germ cells and leydig cells','NEW','12-044','12-028',NULL),
