(380219,'biology','Catalytic converters are fitted into automobiles to reduce emission of harmful gases. They convert unburnt hydrocarbons into?','CO₂  and water','Catalytic converters are fitted into automobiles to reduce emission of harmful gases. Catalytic converters change unburnt hydrocarbons into  CO₂  and water.','Ecology >> Environmental Issues >> Air Pollution and Control',NULL,'2','mcq','CO₂  and water','Carbon monoxide and O₂','Methane and  CO₂','CO₂  and ethane','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
