(380510,'biology','Choose the correct option based on the given assertion and reason: \n\nAssertion(A)-Bee-keeping, Dairy management, Water harvesting, Composting and Agriculture occur in a chain of processes in Integrated Organic Farming\n\nReason (R)-These support each other and allow an extremely economical and sustainable venture generating minimal waste and supporting one another.','Both A and R are correct and R is correct reason for Assertion','Bee-keeping, dairy management, water harvesting, composting and agriculture in a chain of processes, which support each other and allow an extremely economical and sustainable venture.','Ecology >> Environmental Issues >> Agro-chemicals and their Effects',NULL,'1','mcq','Both A and R are correct and R is correct reason for Assertion','A and R both are correct but R is not the correct reason for the Assertion','A and R, both are false','A is true and R is false','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
