(380711,'biology','Which among the following are not caused by UV- B radiation?','Respiratory symptoms','UV-B damages DNA and mutation may occur. It causes aging of skin, damage to skin cells and various types of skin cancers. In human eye, cornea absorbs UV-B radiation, and a high dose of UV-B causes inflammation of cornea, called snow-blindness, cataract, etc. Such exposure may permanently damage the cornea.','Ecology >> Environmental Issues >> Ozone depletion and Stratosphere',NULL,'2','mcq','Skin cancers','Snow-blindness','DNA mutation','Respiratory symptoms','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
