(380902,'biology','______ is the process of restoring a forest that once existed but was removed at some point in the past.','Reforestation','Reforestation is the process of restoring a forest that once existed but was removed at some point of time in the past. Reforestation may occur naturally in a deforested area however we can speed it up by planting trees with due consideration to biodiversity that earlier existed in that area.','Ecology >> Environmental Issues >> Deforestation',NULL,'1','mcq','Reforestation','Cultivation','Re cultivation','Recreating forest','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
