(260914,'biology','The stage at which an embryo is transferred into the uterus?','More than 8 blastomeres','The technique of transfer of more than 8 blastomeres into the uterus is known as IUT- Intra Uterine Transfer.','Reproduction >> Reproductive Health >> Infertility',NULL,'2','mcq','More than 8 blastomeres','Equals to 8 blastomeres','Less than 8 blastomeres','Few blastocysts','NEW','12-064','12-048',NULL),
(260915,'biology','In In-Vivo Fertilisation, embryos are formed through?','Fusion of gametes within the female.','In-vivo fertilisation, the fusion of gametes occur within the female.','Reproduction >> Reproductive Health >> Infertility',NULL,'1','mcq','Fusion of gametes within the female.','Fusion of gametes outside the female.','Fusion of gametes in laboratory in a test tube.','Cloning  a somatic cell','NEW','12-064','12-048',NULL),
(260916,'biology','The transfer of an ovum collected from a donor, into the fallopian tube of another female who cannot produce one, but can provide suitable environment for fertilisation and the fertilised egg\'s further development, is done with the help of which of the following techniques?','GIFT – Gamete Intra Fallopian Transfer','Transfer of an ovum collected from a donor into the fallopian tube of another female is GIFT – Gamete Intra Fallopian Transfer.','Reproduction >> Reproductive Health >> Infertility',NULL,'3','mcq','ET - Embryo Transfer','ZIFT–Zygote Intra Fallopian Transfer)','IUT – Intra Uterine Transfer','GIFT – Gamete Intra Fallopian Transfer','NEW','12-064','12-048',NULL),
(260917,'biology','The procedure in which, a sperm is directly injected into the ovum, is known as?','Intra Cytoplasmic Sperm Injection (ICSI)','Intra Cytoplasmic Sperm Injection is a technique in which a sperm is injected into the Ova directly.','Reproduction >> Reproductive Health >> Infertility',NULL,'3','mcq','Intra Cytoplasmic Sperm Injection (ICSI)','Inter Cytoplasmic Semen Injection (ICSI)','Gamete Intra Fallopian Transfer (GIFT)','Artificial Insemination (AI)','NEW','12-064','12-048',NULL),
(260918,'biology','Which of the following techniques are used to tranfer the semen obtained from the husband or a healthy donor into the female to assist them in reproduction? \ni)Intra cytoplasmic sperm injection (ICSI) \nii)GIFT – gamete intra fallopian transfer \niii)Artificial Insemination (AI) \niv)Intra Uterine Transfer (IUT)','only iii','In Artificial insemination (AI), the semen collected either from the husband or a healthy donor is artificially introduced into the Vagina/Uterus of the female.','Reproduction >> Reproductive Health >> Infertility',NULL,'1','mcq','ii and iii','i and iv','i and iii','only iii','NEW','12-064','12-048',NULL),
(260919,'biology','Select the correct option. In Artificial Insemination, the semen is introduced into the? \ni)Vagina \nii)Uterus \niii)Cervix \niv)Fallopian Tube','i and ii','In the Artificial Insemination technique, the semen is introduced into the vagina or the uterus of the female.','Reproduction >> Reproductive Health >> Infertility',NULL,'2','mcq','i and iii','i and ii','i,ii and iii','iii and iv','NEW','12-064','12-048',NULL),
