(260921,'biology','Infertility issues arising due to the inability of the male partner to inseminate the female, is corrected by which of the following techniques?','AI','In Artificial Insemination, the inability of the male partner to inseminate the female is corrected. It is usually used to help males with low sperm count.','Reproduction >> Reproductive Health >> Infertility',NULL,'3','mcq','ZIFT','AI','GIFT','ICSI','NEW','12-064','12-048',NULL),
