(230424,'biology','Which ability of Bryophyllum is fully exploited by gardeners and farmers for commercial propagation?','Adventitious bud','Adventitious bud of Bryophyllum is fully exploited by gardeners and farmers for commercial propagation.','Reproduction >> Reproduction in Organisms >> Asexual Reproduction 3',NULL,'2','mcq','Rhizome','Adventitious bud','Bud','Tuber','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
