(230512,'chemistry','What name used for Pt in complex cation?','Platinum','(Reference: NCERT Chemistry Class 12; Page 249; Paragraph 2)','Inorganic chemistry >> Coordination Compounds >> Naming of Coordination Compounds',NULL,'1','mcq','Platinum','Platinato','Platinate','Platinyl','NEW','12-249','12-123',NULL),
