(151018,'biology','Choose the correct statement regarding 2, 4-dichlorophenoxyacetic','It is widely used to kill dicotyledonous weeds','2, 4-D, widely used to kill dicotyledonous weeds, does not affect mature monocotyledonous plants. It is used to prepare weed-free lawns by gardeners','Plant Physiology >> Plant Growth and Development >> Auxins',NULL,'3','mcq','It is a natural auxin','It is widely used to kill dicotyledonous weeds','Affect mature monocotyledonous plants','It is widely used to kill monocotyledonous weeds','NEW','11-249','11-176',NULL),
