(191006,'chemistry','A : Lyophillic sols are more stable than lyophobic sols.\nR : Lyophilic sols are more readily hydrated than lyophobic sols.','Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A','Lyophillic sols are more stable because have more interaction with solvent.','Physical chemistry >> Surface chemistry >> Assertion & reason',NULL,'1','mcq','Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A','Both A and R are true but R is NOT the correct explanation of A.','A is true but R is false.','Both A and R are false.','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
