(70219,'biology','Collagen fibres are secreted by -','Fibroblast','Fibroblast produces the collagen fibres and also secretes the ground substance (Reference  : NCERT Biology Class 11: page no:103, paragraph no:3)','Structural Organisation In Plants And Animals >> Structural Organisation In Animals >> Connective Tissue',NULL,'2','mcq','Fibroblast','Mast cells','Histocyte','Macrophages','NEW','11-103',NULL,NULL),
(70220,'biology','Weight-bearing functions is served by','Lower Limb bones, such as the long bones of the leg','Limb bones, such as the long bones of the legs, serve weight-bearing functions.  (Reference  : NCERT Biology Class 11: page no:104, paragraph no:2','Structural Organisation In Plants And Animals >> Structural Organisation In Animals >> Connective Tissue',NULL,'1','mcq','Lower Limb bones, such as the long bones of the leg','Upper Limb bones, such as the short bones of the arm','Upper Limb bones, such as the long bones of the leg','Lower Limb bones, such as the long bones of the arm','NEW','11-104',NULL,NULL),
(70221,'biology','Cartilage is produced by -','Chondrocytes','Chondocyte cells produce cartilage  (Reference  : NCERT Biology Class 11: page no:104, paragraph no:1)','Structural Organisation In Plants And Animals >> Structural Organisation In Animals >> Connective Tissue',NULL,'2','mcq','Fibroblast','Osteoblast','Chondrocytes','Epithelial cells','NEW','11-104',NULL,NULL),
(70222,'biology','Adipocytes are mainly present in -','Connective tissue','They are used for storage of fat (Reference  : NCERT Biology Class 11: page no:103, paragraph no:2)','Structural Organisation In Plants And Animals >> Structural Organisation In Animals >> Connective Tissue',NULL,'2','mcq','Muscular tissue','Nerve tissue','Epithelial tissue','Connective tissue','NEW','11-103',NULL,NULL),
(70223,'biology','Bone forming cells are -','Osteoblasts','Osteoblasts are bone forming cells. It produces matrix which later becomes mineralized. Osteoclasts are cells that break bone. Bone mass is maintained by balancing osteoblasts and osteoclasts process. Chondroblasts are cells which form chondrocytes in the cartilage matrix. Chondroclasts are cells which reabsorb calcified cartilage.','Structural Organisation In Plants And Animals >> Structural Organisation In Animals >> Connective Tissue',NULL,'2','mcq','Osteoclasts','Osteoblasts','Chondroblast','Chondroclasts','NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(70224,'biology','The intercellular material of cartilage is -','Solid, pliable and resists compression','The intercellular material of cartilage is solid and pliable and resists compression.  (Reference  : NCERT Biology Class 11: page no:104, paragraph no:1)','Structural Organisation In Plants And Animals >> Structural Organisation In Animals >> Connective Tissue',NULL,'3','mcq','Hollow, pliable and resists compression','Solid, not pliable and resists compression','Solid, pliable and resists compression','Solid, pliable and does not resist compression','NEW','11-104',NULL,NULL),
(70225,'biology','Cells of cartilage (chondrocyte) are enclosed in small cavities within the matrix secreted by-','Chondrocyte','Chondrocyte cells secrete the matrix (Reference  : NCERT Biology Class 11: page no:104, paragraph no:1)','Structural Organisation In Plants And Animals >> Structural Organisation In Animals >> Connective Tissue',NULL,'2','mcq','Osteolast','Osteoblast','Chondrocyte','Chondroclasts','NEW','11-104',NULL,NULL),
(70226,'biology','Which of the following statements is correct?','Cartilage is less vascular than bone and makes up parts of nose tip, intervertebral discs, etc','Most of the cartilage is replaced by bones in adult, Cartilage is less vascular than bone and makes up parts of nose tip, intervertebral discs, etc (Reference  : NCERT Biology Class 11: page no:104, paragraph no:1)','Structural Organisation In Plants And Animals >> Structural Organisation In Animals >> Connective Tissue',NULL,'3','mcq','Most of the cartilage is not replaced by ligaments in adult','Bones make up nose-tip, intervertebral disc, limbs and hands in adult, outer ear joints','Cartilage is more vascular than bone.','Cartilage is less vascular than bone and makes up parts of nose tip, intervertebral discs, etc','NEW','11-104',NULL,NULL),
