(70312,'biology','Which of the following statement is incorrect?','The human body is composed of millions of cells to perform various functions','The human body is composed of billions of cells to perform various functions','Structural Organisation In Plants And Animals >> Structural Organisation In Animals >> Muscle And Neural Tissue',NULL,'1','mcq','In unicellular organisms, all functions like digestion, respiration and reproduction are performed by a single cell','The human body is composed of millions of cells to perform various functions','In the complex body of multicellular animals the same basic functions are carried out by different groups of cells in a well organised manner.Humans have Organ system level of organisation.','Cells, tissues, organs and\norgan systems split up the work in a way that exhibits division of labour\nand contribute to the survival of the body as a whole.','NEW','11-100',NULL,NULL),
