(70426,'biology','In pheretima, haemoglobin','Is dissolved in plasma','They produce blood cells and haemoglobin which is dissolved in blood plasma. Blood cells are phagocytic in nature.  (Reference  : NCERT Biology Class 11: page no:108, paragraph no:2)','Structural Organisation In Plants And Animals >> Structural Organisation In Animals >> Earthworm',NULL,'2','mcq','is not the main respiratorty pigment','Is dissolved in plasma','is present within RBCs','present within phagocytes','NEW','11-108',NULL,NULL),
