(270209,'biology','Mendel  conducted  such  artificial\npollination/cross pollination experiments\nusing ____?','Several True -breeding Pea lines','Mendel  conducted  such  artificial pollination/cross pollination experiments using several true-breeding pea lines. Reference   : NCERT Page No.70','Genetics and Evolution >> Principles Of Inheritance And Variation >> Mendel\'s Laws Of Inheritance',NULL,'1','mcq','Few True breeding lines','Traits of True Breeding','Several True -breeding Pea lines','False breeding peas','NEW','12-070','12-054',NULL),
(270210,'biology','True breeding lines are selected through continuous_____________','Self Pollination','Mendel\'s experiments\nusing several true-breeding pea lines. A true-breeding line is one that,having undergone\ncontinuous self-pollination','Genetics and Evolution >> Principles Of Inheritance And Variation >> Mendel\'s Laws Of Inheritance',NULL,'1','mcq','Self Pollination','Cross Pollination','Mutation','Variation','NEW','12-070','12-054',NULL),
(270211,'biology','Which of the following is INCORRECT accordingly to the True Breeding Lines?','stable trait expression for one generation only','True-breeding line is one that, having undergone continuous self-pollination,shows the stable trait inheritance and\nexpression for several generations. Reference   : NCERT class 12  Page No.70','Genetics and Evolution >> Principles Of Inheritance And Variation >> Mendel\'s Laws Of Inheritance',NULL,'1','mcq','Shows the stable trait Inheritance','stable trait expression for several generations','Undergone continuous self-pollination','stable trait expression for one generation only','NEW','12-070','12-054',NULL),
