(350706,'biology','The bears going into hibernation during winter is an example of escape in__________','Time','The familiar case of bears going into hibernation during winter is an example of escape in time.(Reference  :NCERT Biology Class 12: page no:225, paragraph no:3)','Ecology >> Organisms And Populations >> Migrate and Suspend',NULL,'2','fillup','Ti,me',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NEW','12-225',NULL,NULL),
(350707,'biology','To avoid dessication, fishes undergoes:','Aestivation','Some snails and fish go into aestivation to avoid summer–related problems-heat and desiccation.(Reference  :NCERT Biology Class 12: page no:225, paragraph no:3)','Ecology >> Organisms And Populations >> Migrate and Suspend',NULL,'2','mcq','Hibernation','Aestivation','Escape of time','Migration','NEW','12-225',NULL,NULL),
