(130214,'biology','In which region of split light spectrum bacteria got accumulated in T.W Engelmann\'s experiment','Blue and red','In the blue and red colored region of the split spectrum the bacteria got accumulated to detect the O₂ evolution sites. (Reference  : NCERT Class 11th, Pg. 208)','Plant Physiology >> Photosynthesis in higher plants >> Early Experiments',NULL,'1','mcq','Blue and violet','Blue and green','Red and violet','Blue and red','NEW','11-208','11-135',NULL),
(130215,'biology','In Englemann\'s experiment,Absorption spectra of Cladophora roughly resembled that of','Chlorophyll a and b','As a result of Englemann\'s experiment the first action spectrum of photosynthesis was observed. It resembled the absorption spectra of chlorophyll a and b. (Reference  : NCERT Class 11th, Pg. 208)','Plant Physiology >> Photosynthesis in higher plants >> Early Experiments',NULL,'1','mcq','Chlorophyll a only','Chlorophyll b only','Chlorophyll a and b','Chlorophyll a,c and d','NEW','11-208','11-135',NULL),
