(221020,'biology','The corticoids, which are involved in carbohydrate metabolism are called________','Glucocorticoids','The corticoids, which are involved in carbohydrate metabolism are called glucocorticoids.(Reference  :NCERT Biology Class 11;page 337;paragraph No.2)..','Human Physiology >> Chemical Coordination and Integration >> Adrenal Gland',NULL,'3','mcq','Glucocorticoids','Catecholamines','Mineralocorticoids','TSH','NEW','11-337','11-245',NULL),
