(221024,'biology','Glucocorticoids stimulate all except-','Utilisation of amino acids','Glucocorticoids stimulate gluconeogenesis, lipolysis and proteolysis; and inhibit cellular uptake and utilisation of amino acids.(Reference  :NCERT Biology Class 11;page 337;paragraph No.2)..','Human Physiology >> Chemical Coordination and Integration >> Adrenal Gland',NULL,'3','mcq','Gluconeogenesis','Utilisation of amino acids','Lipolysis','Proteolysis','NEW','11-337','11-245',NULL),
