(221026,'biology','How many statements are correct regarding the function of Cortisol? Cortisol maintains: \ni. Cardio-vascular system \nii. Kidney functions \niii. CNS functions \niv. Reproductive functions mainly','2','Cortisol is also involved in maintaining the cardio-vascular system as well as the kidney functions..(Reference  :NCERT Biology Class 11;page 337;paragraph No.2).','Human Physiology >> Chemical Coordination and Integration >> Adrenal Gland',NULL,'3','mcq','1','2','3','4','NEW','11-337','11-245',NULL),
(221027,'biology','Cortisol stimulates production of-','RBC','Glucocorticoids, particularly cortisol, produces antiinflammatory reactions and suppresses the immune response. Cortisol stimulates the RBC production.(Reference  :NCERT Biology Class 11;page 337;paragraph No.2).','Human Physiology >> Chemical Coordination and Integration >> Adrenal Gland',NULL,'3','mcq','WBC','Platelets','RBC','Fibroblasts','NEW','11-337','11-245',NULL),
