(221201,'biology','A pair of testis is present in the ________.','Scrotal Sac','A pair of testis is present in the scrotal sac.(Reference  :NCERT Biology Class 11;page 338;paragraph No.3).','Human Physiology >> Chemical Coordination and Integration >> Testis',NULL,'2','mcq','Rectal region','Scrotal Sac','Abdomen','Liver','NEW','11-338','11-246',NULL),
