(221203,'biology','Testis is composed of ______ and _______. \ni. Seminiferous tubules  \nii.Thecal cells  \niii.Interstitial tissue \niv.Zona pellucida','i and iii only','Testis is composed of seminiferous tubules and stromal or interstitial tissue..(Reference  :NCERT Biology Class 11;page 338;paragraph No.3).','Human Physiology >> Chemical Coordination and Integration >> Testis',NULL,'3','mcq','i and ii only','i and iii only','ii and iv only','i,ii,iii and iv','NEW','11-338','11-246',NULL),
(221204,'biology','Another name of Leydig cells is _______.','Interstitial cells','Leydig cells or interstitial cells, which are present in the intertubular spaces produce a group of hormones called androgens mainly testosterone.(Reference  :NCERT Biology Class 11;page 338;paragraph No.3)..','Human Physiology >> Chemical Coordination and Integration >> Testis',NULL,'3','mcq','Interstitial cells','Peptide cells','Stem cells','Lamellar cells','NEW','11-338','11-246',NULL),
(221205,'biology','Testosterone is produced by ____ cells.','Leydig','Leydig cells or interstitial cells, which are present in the intertubular spaces produce a group of hormones called androgens mainly testosterone..(Reference  :NCERT Biology Class 11;page 338;paragraph No.3).','Human Physiology >> Chemical Coordination and Integration >> Testis',NULL,'2','mcq','Leydig','Peptide','Stem','Stromal','NEW','11-338','11-246',NULL),
