(221207,'biology','Formation of spermatozoa is called _______.','Spermatogenesis','Androgens play a major stimulatory role in the process of spermatogenesis (formation of spermatozoa).(Reference  :NCERT Biology Class 11;page 338;paragraph No.4)..','Human Physiology >> Chemical Coordination and Integration >> Testis',NULL,'3','mcq','Hepatocytis','Glucose Homeostasis','Glycogenesis','Spermatogenesis','NEW','11-338','11-246',NULL),
