(241603,'chemistry','Propene → Nitropropane\n\nThe reaction can be carried out by ?','Treating with HBr in the presence of peroxide followed by AgNO2','Reaction will proceed as given in the diagram(ne2450)','Organic Chemistry >> Haloalkanes and Haloarenes >> Conversion Reactions',NULL,'3','mcq','Treating with AgNO2 in the presence of peroxide','Treating with HBr in the presence of peroxide followed by AgNO2','Treating with AgNO2 followed by Alc. KOH','Treating with Br2 followed by Alc. KOH','NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
