(300403,'chemistry','H.W. Florey and Alexander Fleming shared the Nobel prize for Medicine in 1945 for their independent contributions to the development of ____________.','penicillin','H.W. Florey and Alexander Fleming shared the Nobel prize for Medicine in 1945 for their independent contributions to the development of penicillin.','Organic Chemistry >> Chemistry in everydaylife >> Therapeutic action of different classes of Drugs 3',NULL,'1','fillup','dy,sid,az,iri,ne,Va,nco,my,cin,Chlo,ramp,henic,ol,pe,nic,illin',NULL,NULL,NULL,'DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(300404,'chemistry','The compound Phenol act as-','All of these','Same substances can act as an antiseptic as well as disinfectant by varying the concentration. For example, 0.2 per cent  solution of phenol is an antiseptic while its one percent solution is disinfectant.(Reference: NCERT Chemistry Class 12; Page 456 Para 1 )','Organic Chemistry >> Chemistry in everydaylife >> Therapeutic action of different classes of Drugs 3',NULL,'1','mcq','Disinfectants','Antimicrobial','Antiseptic','All of these','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(300405,'chemistry','Which of the following is true :','Antiseptics and disinfectants are also the chemicals which either kill or prevent the growth of microorganisms.','(Reference: NCERT Chemistry Class 12; Page 456 Para 1 )','Organic Chemistry >> Chemistry in everydaylife >> Therapeutic action of different classes of Drugs 3',NULL,'2','mcq','Antiseptics and disinfectants are also the chemicals which prevent the growth of microorganisms only','Antiseptics and disinfectants are also the chemicals which  kill the growth of microorganisms only.','Antiseptics and disinfectants are also the chemicals which either kill or prevent the growth of microorganisms.','All the above are true','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
