(300409,'chemistry','Boric acid in dilute aqueous solution is _______.','weak antiseptic for eyes','Boric acid in dilute aqueous solution is weak antiseptic for eyes.(Reference: NCERT Chemistry Class 12; Page 456 Para 1 )','Organic Chemistry >> Chemistry in everydaylife >> Therapeutic action of different classes of Drugs 3',NULL,'1','mcq','weak antiseptic for ear','Strong antiseptic for eyes','weak antiseptic for eyes','Strong antiseptic for ear','DELETED',NULL,NULL,NULL),
