(301011,'biology','Spleen contains mainly-','Lymphocytes,phagocytes,erythrocytes','The spleen is a large bean shaped organ. It mainly contains lymphocytes and phagocytes. It acts as a filter of the blood by trapping blood-borne microorganisms. Spleen also has a large reservoir of erythrocytes.','Biology In Human Welfare >> Human Health and Disease >> Immune System in the Body',NULL,'2','mcq','Lymphocytes,phagocytes,erythrocytes','Neutrophils,phagocytes,erythrocytes','Eosinophils,lymphocytes,phagocytes','Lymphocytes,basophils,erythrocytes','NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(301012,'biology','__________acts as a filter of the blood by trapping blood-borne microorganisms.','Spleen','The spleen is a large bean shaped organ. It mainly contains lymphocytes and phagocytes. It acts as a filter of the blood by trapping blood-borne microorganisms. Spleen also has a large reservoir of erythrocytes.','Biology In Human Welfare >> Human Health and Disease >> Immune System in the Body',NULL,'2','mcq','Thymus','Spleen','Bone marrow','Tonsils','NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(301013,'biology','________ serve to trap the micro-organisms or other antigens, which happen to get into the lymph and tissue fluid.','Lymph nodes','The lymph nodes are small solid structures located at different points along the lymphatic system. Lymph nodes serve to trap the microorganisms or other antigens, which happen to get into the lymph and tissue fluid.','Biology In Human Welfare >> Human Health and Disease >> Immune System in the Body',NULL,'2','mcq','Lymph nodes','Spleen','Lymphatic vessels','Tonsils','NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
