(301015,'biology','Lymphoid tissue located within the lining of the major tracts (respiratory, digestive and urogenital tracts) is called-','MALT','There is lymphoid tissue also located within the lining of the major tracts (respiratory, digestive and urogenital tracts) called mucosa associated lymphoid tissue (MALT).','Biology In Human Welfare >> Human Health and Disease >> Immune System in the Body',NULL,'2','mcq','Bone marrow','Thymus','Spleen','MALT','NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
