(301101,'biology','AIDS maybe congenitally acquired','FALSE','The word AIDS stands for acquired immunodeficiency syndrome. This means deficiency of immune system, acquired during the lifetime of an individual indicating that it is not a congenital disease','Biology In Human Welfare >> Human Health and Disease >> AIDS',NULL,'1','mcq','TRUE','FALSE',NULL,NULL,'NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
