(301104,'biology','AIDS is caused by the-','HIV','AIDS is caused by the human immunodeficiency virus (HIV), a member of a group of viruses called retrovirus, which have an envelope enclosing the RNA genome','Biology In Human Welfare >> Human Health and Disease >> AIDS',NULL,'1','mcq','RSV','HIV','Coxsackie virus','Cytomegalovirus','NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
