(301212,'biology','_______________in normal cells which, when activated under certain conditions, could lead to oncogenic transformation of the cells','Proto oncogenes','Several genes called cellular oncogenes (C-onc) or proto oncogenes have been identified in normal cells which, when activated under certain conditions, could lead to oncogenic transformation of the cells','Biology In Human Welfare >> Human Health and Disease >> Cancer',NULL,'2','mcq','Proto oncogenes','Cellular substance','Endonuclease','Viral oncogenes','NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
