(301325,'biology','Erythroxylum coca is native to ___________.','South america','Coca alkaloid or cocaine is obtained from coca plant erythroxylum coca, native to south america.','Biology In Human Welfare >> Human Health and Disease >> Drugs and Alcohol Abuse',NULL,'2','mcq','South africa','South america','Canada','North africa','NEW',NULL,NULL,NULL),
